The '''Wyrmgrove Tomb''' is a sub-location of the [[Moonglade Marsh]].

== Features ==
The '''Wyrmgrove Tomb''' is a large tomb composed of stone brick walls with several floors connected via staircases. {{MobSprite|Chillshot;Chillshots}} and {{MobSprite|Chillblade;Chillblades}} also spawn here.

=== Tomb Floodway ===
{{Main|Tomb Floodway}}
The {{zone|Tomb Floodway}} is primarily a {{Skill|Fishing}} location. No [[Sea Creatures]] can be caught while in the {{zone|Tomb Floodway}}. Additionally, it grants a passive {{stat|treasure chance|10}} and is the only place {{Item|Flexbone}}s can be caught.

=== Bubbleboost Column ===
{{Main|Bubbleboost Column}}
The {{zone|Bubbleboost Column}} is a shortcut back to {{Zone|Tangleburg}}. Teleporting down instead leads to the {{Zone|Kelpwoven Tunnels}}.

